{"id":"n70525-2-7","stage":5,"title":"여의다 · 嫁出","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70525-2-7-1","ko":"자식들을 다 여의셨으니 이제 한 시름 놓으시겠어요.","zh":"孩子们都成家了，您总算可以松口气了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자식들을","meaning":"子女","explanation":"자식：子女；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자식","audio":"/audio/b642f4b4b990f8387501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49308","senseId":"1","lemma":"자식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자식들을","audio":"/audio/99d0d6c1fba52335a65f.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"여의셨으니","meaning":"嫁出，嫁女","explanation":"여의다：嫁出，嫁女；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"여의다","audio":"/audio/482280ff7a81b5ddfec9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70525","senseId":"2","lemma":"여의다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여의셨으니","audio":"/audio/b43bd42cf3f8dca842e9.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"시름","meaning":"忧心事，忧愁","explanation":"시름：忧心事，忧愁。","readings":[{"term":"시름","audio":"/audio/beeda9fc18b7ae351586.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66294","senseId":"1","lemma":"시름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시름","audio":"/audio/beeda9fc18b7ae351586.mp3"}},{"text":"놓으시겠어요.","meaning":"放心，放下","explanation":"놓다：放心，放下；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"3","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓으시겠어요","audio":"/audio/0f3ed53175f0259f3796.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b642f4b4b990f838","term":"자식","zh":"子女","audio":"/audio/b642f4b4b990f8387501.mp3","entryId":"49308","definition":"儿子和女儿，或单指儿子或女儿。","pronunciation":["자식"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"一点不剩或不落下而全部。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"482280ff7a81b5dd","term":"여의다","zh":"嫁出，嫁女","audio":"/audio/482280ff7a81b5ddfec9.mp3","entryId":"70525","definition":"女儿结婚。","pronunciation":["여의다","여이다"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"beeda9fc18b7ae35","term":"시름","zh":"忧心事，忧愁","audio":"/audio/beeda9fc18b7ae351586.mp3","entryId":"66294","definition":"放在心上没有解决，一直留有的忧虑和担心。","pronunciation":["시름"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放心，放下","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"忘掉或消除担忧或紧张等。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e6df5b00293f3e20dee1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70525-2-7-2","ko":"그러게요, 인생에서 큰 숙제 끝낸 것 같네요.","zh":"是啊，感觉完成了人生中的一项大任务。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게요,","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게요","audio":"/audio/cd2f15cf7e4066dccc42.mp3"}},{"text":"인생에서","meaning":"人生","explanation":"인생：人生；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"인생","audio":"/audio/f5266ca313518a9f06d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62449","senseId":"1","lemma":"인생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인생에서","audio":"/audio/605efa26e76a83c429c8.mp3"}},{"text":"큰","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"숙제","meaning":"课题","explanation":"숙제：课题。","readings":[{"term":"숙제","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65226","senseId":"2","lemma":"숙제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숙제","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3"}},{"text":"끝낸","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝내다：结束，完成；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"끝내다","audio":"/audio/686f8e089bf22cd01d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29692","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝낸","audio":"/audio/7cc69257a67c1db19dcf.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같네요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"ter